{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfYAuzo7BFTZ82YrYuj3Y","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Answer: Rubosi\nActions taken: none\n\nRubosi is the only hoist that meets both requirements. It is rated for 474 kg, which covers the 450 kg load, and its 205 cm hook height is within the 210 cm limit. Yewute is rated for only 448 kg, and its 218 cm hook height is too high. Bido can carry the weight at 503 kg, but its 223 cm hook height exceeds the limit. Fuwizo fails both, at 378 kg and 239 cm."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":404,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":168,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"diagnostics":null}